{
  "id": "423301",
  "resourceId": 233,
  "name": "桃樂絲",
  "skin": "月光",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c233_02_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c233_02_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "我將帶領閣下前往樂園。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "歲月靜好的故事無論說多少次都不會膩。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "偶像？真不懂拉毗到底在想什麼。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "願這些有資格之人都能得到樂園的祝福。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "今日的相逢，日後也會成為回憶吧。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "要我唱歌跳舞？\n……您覺得這像話嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "這是伊甸園的裝備，您喜歡嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "我們，真的走過了很長一段路吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "聽說偶像要帶給人們喜悅與快樂。\n我為什麼非做那種事不可？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "如果目標一致，今後就能待在身邊了吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "……那段時光真是無比輝煌。\n我們都在一起，這就已經足夠了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "粉絲服務？\n哼，像揮揮手這種程度，我還做得到啦。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "閣下您這把鑰匙，我以後也會善加利用的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "小紅帽，莉莉絲。\n兩人都沒有見過皮娜吧？我來介紹一下。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "閣下其實也蠻適合當偶像的。\n這只是我的個人看法，不必放心上。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "樂園裡的生活不值得期待嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "多待一會再走吧。還有很多甜點，也有很多時間呢。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "如果閣下的願望是聽我唱歌，\n也不是不能滿足您。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼一句話都不說？\n該不會是把我丟在這裡，自己去做別的事了吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "大家都去哪裡了？\n趁著茶還沒涼，要快點回來。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "拉毗說，偶像應該會忙得不可開交。\n把我晾在這裡，真的沒問題嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "如果您還有事，就去忙吧。\n我就在這裡看著閣下。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "好久沒見面了啊。\n再和我聊點大家的事吧。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "哼、哼哼♬",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "既不是方舟，也不是伊甸園的地方。\n呵呵……這裡和您還真像啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "啊，對不起。我今天已經有約了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "出道表演要選在鮮花公園？\n我不打算做那種事，請別說些奇怪的話。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "這裡是您打造的樂園嗎？\n真有趣。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "差不多該去參加派對了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "我不想用這副模樣見任何人。\n請回去。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "勝利之翼嗎……\n呵呵，一群弱不禁風的人聚在一起，弄出了個沒用的東西啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "地面的陽光真好啊。\n像今天這樣的日子，待在下面太可惜了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "您有沒有看到拉毗？\n我不會做任何事，\n告訴我她在哪就好。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "恭喜您，我是樂園的嚮導，桃樂絲。\n聽從閣下的召喚來此。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "真是個陽光明媚的好日子啊。\n皮娜，邀請大家來參加茶會怎麼樣？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "哈啊……閃耀吧，日暮之光。\n大家好，我是Twilight的桃樂絲。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "您將會看到與您的誠意相當的成果。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "為了守護所有人。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "身體變輕了。\n……這不是要跳舞的意思。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "感謝您的用心。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "只要和你們在一起，\n我就能變得更強。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "還不錯，感謝您的支援。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "方舟的強化技術也不錯嘛。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "戰鬥請交給我吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "我現在沒空去當什麼偶像，\n閣下應該也很清楚這一點吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "原來這就是閣下管理妮姬的方式啊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝，我會好好珍藏的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "禮物啊……\n這種東西不是應該由偶像送給粉絲的嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "您是想得到我的關注嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "呵呵，我快熱淚盈眶了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "閣下該不會是想要回報吧？\n例如要我唱歌，或是跳舞之類的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "閣下的努力會得到回報的，\n無論是以哪種方式。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "有什麼我能為您效勞的嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "我先收下了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "最近我感興趣的，只有閣下您。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "我們要一直在一起。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "粉絲與偶像的愛情故事太老套了。\n不過，老套總有它存在的理由。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "您成功地引起了我的注意。\n這下滿意了嗎？",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "雖說沒有什麼是永恆的，但我還是有所期待。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "最近，我感受到各式各樣的情緒。\n多虧了閣下。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "想要利用閣下的心思，和想要得到您的心思，\n這個天秤會往哪邊傾斜呢……我也很期待呢。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "原來幸福，就是這樣的啊。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "擔心會和閣下傳出緋聞？\n哼，倒是個很有趣的設定。",
      "animation": "smile"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "既然閣下需要，那我就陪著您吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "我來當前鋒。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "不管怎樣，該做的還是得做。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "您在找我嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "我在這裡。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "您找我嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "好，聽您的，這就出發。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "各位，該行動了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "是，馬上出發。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "來了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "遇敵。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "我的心情很差，這樣正好。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "您不用緊張，有我在。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "如果是我們的話，一定能贏。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "快點解決掉吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_79",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_79.mp3",
      "text": "讓您看看伊甸園的技術。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_80",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_80.mp3",
      "text": "大家不要勉強。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_81",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_81.mp3",
      "text": "……真是麻煩。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_82",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_82.mp3",
      "text": "很快就能結束，您先休息一下。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_83",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_83.mp3",
      "text": "開戰吧，為了未來。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_84",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_84.mp3",
      "text": "速戰速決。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_85",
      "category": "換彈I",
